[{"id":"app-testing-monkey-ignore-errors","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"App测试","tags":["Monkey","稳定性"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十一)Monkey 稳定性测试.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十一)Monkey 稳定性测试","articlePath":"posts/d377608d/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(十一)Monkey 稳定性测试.md","articleTitle":"App测试(十一)Monkey 稳定性测试","articlePath":"posts/d377608d/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>忽略 Crash 和超时的参数为什么不能作为通过条件？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它们只让 Monkey 继续发送事件或改变退出行为，不能消除 Crash、ANR 或业务错误。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>忽略选项适合探索性长跑，但报告必须保留原始输出、错误计数和系统日志。发现异常后应停止扩大运行，按 seed、时间线和系统证据复现，而不是用忽略参数掩盖失败。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-DIAG-005","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["抓包","安全","证据链"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/"}],"articleIndex":5,"articleCount":10,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>抓包和 HAR 分享前后最重要的安全边界是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>只采集获准范围，限制接口/主机/包数，脱敏 Cookie、Authorization、查询参数和内部地址，完成后精确清理文件和自己启动的进程。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>抓包成功不等于可以公开。报告应保留最小证据、记录过滤器和验证层级，不修改全局信任库、DNS 或权限来制造通过结果。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>证据采集的最小安全闭环是：\u003c/p>\n\u003col>\n\u003cli>先限定主机、接口、时间和包数；\u003c/li>\n\u003cli>再脱敏 Cookie、Authorization、查询参数和内部地址；\u003c/li>\n\u003cli>最后只清理自己创建的文件与进程，不改变全局信任库或权限。\u003c/li>\n\u003c/ol>\n\u003cp>抓到内容只说明观察成功，不自动赋予公开或共享权限。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-DIAG-FAQ-002","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","502","网关"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/"}],"articleIndex":7,"articleCount":10,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>502 一定是后端服务挂了吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不一定。502 是某个网关观察到上游响应无效的 HTTP 结果，问题可能在网关到上游的 DNS、TCP、TLS、分帧或代理配置。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>必须查看网关和上游的对应时间线；客户端收到 502 不能单独定位上游哪一步失败。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>可把错误放到一条时间线上：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">DNS → TCP → TLS → HTTP 网关 → 上游服务\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">无 IP   RST/超时  证书/握手  502/504   应用结果\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>每个错误字符串都要回到对应报文、响应头或服务端日志；不要把缺少 HTTP 响应的失败写成 4xx/5xx。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-CAP-FAQ-001","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["面试","OSI","请求链路"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(九)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(九)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e25e16df/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(九)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(九)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e25e16df/"}],"articleIndex":9,"articleCount":11,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>面试中应该先讲 OSI 七层还是先讲请求链路？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先确认题目要解释的现象，再用请求链路定位证据，必要时用 OSI/TCP-IP 模型补充边界。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>死背七层名称不能替代“请求是否解析、连接、握手、返回 HTTP”的事实。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>面试或排障可以沿同一条可观察链路回答：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">名称解析 → 路由/下一跳 → TCP/QUIC → TLS → HTTP → 业务结果\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>OSI/TCP-IP 模型用来标注职责和边界；先讲现象与证据，再补模型，比按层背诵更容易说明哪里失败。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-L2-002","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["以太网","帧"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/"}],"articleIndex":8,"articleCount":18,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>以太网帧中目的 MAC、源 MAC、类型字段和 FCS 分别有什么作用？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>目的/源 MAC 标识当前链路交付双方，类型字段指示载荷协议，FCS 用于检测帧传输错误。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>帧字段服务于链路层；IP、TCP、HTTP 字段不应与它们混为一谈。抓包还可能受网卡校验和卸载影响。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>排障时可以把证据写成一条逐层收窄的记录：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>观察点\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>能确认\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>还不能确认\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>ARP/ND 或 FDB\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>当前链路的下一跳线索\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>IP 路由和应用响应\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>TCP/TLS 握手\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>传输或安全会话建立\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>HTTP 状态和业务结果\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>HTTP 响应\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>某个服务返回了应用层结果\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>业务数据一定正确\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>这样“看到字段”会变成有边界的证据，而不是把某一层的成功扩大成端到端成功。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a8-rsync-scp","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["传输","rsync"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障.md","articleTitle":"Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障","articlePath":"posts/3a757ef9/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障.md","articleTitle":"Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障","articlePath":"posts/3a757ef9/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>scp 和 rsync 的主要选择边界是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>scp 适合简单复制，rsync 适合增量同步、dry-run 和大目录；两者都需确认远端路径与权限。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>选择同步方式时先明确“复制一次”还是“让目标镜像源”：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">scp report.csv user@example.com:incoming/\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">rsync -avhn --delete ./build/ user@example.com:incoming/build/\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>scp\u003c/code> 适合小规模单次复制；\u003ccode>rsync\u003c/code> 能按差异传输并用 \u003ccode>--dry-run\u003c/code> 预览，但 \u003ccode>--delete\u003c/code> 会删除目标中源端不存在的文件。先核对源、目标、用户和排除规则，再去掉 \u003ccode>-n\u003c/code>，并保存预览结果。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a10-load-cpu","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["性能","CPU"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十)性能分析与资源诊断.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十)性能分析与资源诊断","articlePath":"posts/997240e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十)性能分析与资源诊断.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十)性能分析与资源诊断","articlePath":"posts/997240e7/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>load average 为什么不能直接当作 CPU 使用率？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>load 包含可运行和部分不可中断等待任务，可能被 I/O、锁或设备延迟推高。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>load average\u003c/code> 是等待运行或不可中断睡眠的任务数量，不是百分比。先把它和 CPU 数量、运行队列、I/O 等待放在同一时间窗：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">nproc\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">uptime\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">mpstat -P ALL 1 3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">vmstat 1 3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>如果 load 接近 8，但 8 个 CPU 的 idle 很高而 \u003ccode>wa\u003c/code> 上升，瓶颈更可能在 I/O；如果运行队列持续超过 CPU 数且 idle 接近 0，才支持 CPU 饱和。单看一个平均值无法区分这两种原因。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a11-set-e","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["Bash","错误处理"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化","articlePath":"posts/496664b1/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十一)Bash 脚本与任务自动化","articlePath":"posts/496664b1/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么不能把 set -e 当作完整异常处理？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>errexit 在 if、&amp;&amp;/||、管道、函数和命令替换等上下文有例外，某些失败不会退出。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>set -e\u003c/code> 不是异常类型系统，它会根据语法上下文决定是否退出：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">set\u003c/span> -Eeuo pipefail\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">if\u003c/span> ! output=$(may_fail); \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">then\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;可恢复失败&#x27;\u003c/span> &gt;&amp;2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">exit\u003c/span> 1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">fi\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">trap\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;printf &quot;error line=%s status=%s\\\\n&quot; &quot;$LINENO&quot; &quot;$?&quot; &gt;&amp;2&#x27;\u003c/span> ERR\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>if\u003c/code> 条件、\u003ccode>&amp;&amp;\u003c/code>/\u003ccode>||\u003c/code>、管道、函数作为条件调用和命令替换都可能改变 \u003ccode>errexit\u003c/code> 的效果。明确使用 \u003ccode>if\u003c/code>/\u003ccode>return\u003c/code> 表达可恢复分支，再用 \u003ccode>pipefail\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>ERR\u003c/code> 日志和测试覆盖补齐证据，不能把“脚本退出了”当作完整错误处理。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a13-apply-gate","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["变更","回滚"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十三)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十三)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/c0dffe07/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十三)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十三)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/c0dffe07/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么综合排障模板把 APPLY 默认设为 0？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它避免在未保存证据、未获授权或没有回滚方案时对服务做真实变更。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>APPLY=0\u003c/code> 是把观察阶段和变更阶段隔开的闸门：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">APPLY=\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$&#123;APPLY:-0&#125;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">if\u003c/span> [[ \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$APPLY\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span> != 1 ]]; \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">then\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;report-only: no service mutation&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">exit\u003c/span> 0\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">fi\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 只有目标、批准、回滚命令和复测条件已记录，才进入这里。\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">systemctl restart \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"variable\">$SERVICE\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>把默认值设为 0，可以让同一份脚本先生成报告；只有目标明确、影响获批、回滚可执行且复测指标已定义时，才显式传入 \u003ccode>APPLY=1\u003c/code>，并且一次只执行一个动作。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]